# BORGHERTZS_LURKING_HANDS (jeuno 56): the two optional coffers' sections (status not available, main job NIN, the
# [AF]ZilartCoffer bit unset). Accepted by a GM, a level 75 NIN: SeaSerpentGrotto's Treasure Coffer opens to
# NinjaKyahan (the item bypass; the result is the item): [AF]ZilartCoffer +33554432 (bit 25); TheBoyahdaTree's to
# NinjaHatsuburi: +67108864 (bit 26).
lists SeaSerpentGrotto/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade TheBoyahdaTree/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=SeaSerpentGrotto pos=189.673,18.999,30.161 job=NIN lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsLurkingHands accepted
item GrottoCofferKey
item BoyahdaCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer GrottoCofferKey x1 # bit 25 unset: NinjaKyahan; [AF]ZilartCoffer 33554432
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp -11,-19,-177 TheBoyahdaTree
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer BoyahdaCofferKey x1 # bit 26 unset: NinjaHatsuburi; [AF]ZilartCoffer 100663296
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
